    ./cycle.cue:16:7
    ./cycle.cue:12:12
    ./cycle.cue:16:14
stillCyclic.indirect.data.a.a: structural cycle:
    ./cycle.cue:16:7
[eval] stillCyclic.selection.data.a: invalid value {b:"foo"} (does not satisfy matchN): 0 matched, expected 1:
    ./cycle.cue:25:7
    ./cycle.cue:22:12
    ./cycle.cue:25:14
stillCyclic.selection.data.a: invalid value {b:"foo"} (does not satisfy matchN): structural cycle:
